The list of disposable domains in this directory is generated from
https://github.com/disposable-email-domains/disposable-email-domains, whose
contributors dedicated it to the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0
1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication:
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The list of top-level domains in this directory is generated from
https://data.iana.org/TLD/tlds-alpha-by-domain.txt, published by the Internet
Assigned Numbers Authority (IANA), which operates the DNS root zone. It is a
list of facts, the names delegated in the root zone, given here with its source.
